lain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 has no such authority, but habitually maintains in the first-mentioned Party a stock of goods or merchandise from which he regularly delivers goods or merchandise on behalf of the enterprise.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 An enterprise of a Contracting Party shall not be deemed to have a permanent establishment in the other Contracting Party merely because it carries on business in that other Contracting Party through a broker, general commission agent or any other agent of an independent status, provided that such persons are acting in the ordinary course of their business. However, when the activities of such an agent are devoted wholly or almost wholly on behalf of that enterprise, and conditions are made or imposed between that enterprise and the agent in their commercial and financial relations which differ from those which would have been made between independent enterprises, he will not be considered an agent of an independent status within the meaning of this paragraph.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The fact that a company which is a resident of a Contracting Party controls or is controlled by a company which is a resident of the other Contracting Party, or which carries on business in that other Party (whether through a permanent establishment or otherwise), shall not of itself constitute either company a permanent establishment of the other.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u160??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 CHAPTER III\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 TAXATION OF INCOME\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 6\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 INCOME FROM IMMOVABLE PROPERTY\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Income derived by a resident of a Contracting Party from immovable property (including income from agriculture or forestry) situated in the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The term \u8220??immovable property\u8221?? shall have the meaning which it has under the law of the Contracting Party in which the property in question is situated. The term shall in any case include property accessory to immovable property, livestock and equipment used in agriculture and forestry, rights to which the provisions of general law respecting landed property apply, usufruct of immovable property and rights to variable or fixed payments as consideration for the working of, or the right to work, mineral deposits, quarries, sources and other natural resources; ships, boats and aircraft shall not be regarded as immovable property.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall apply to income derived from the direct use, letting, or use in any other form of immovable property.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall also apply to the income from immovable property of an enterprise and to income from immovable property used for the performance of independent personal services.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 7\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 BUSINESS PROFITS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The profits of an enterprise of a Contracting Party shall be taxable only in that Party unless the enterprise carries on business in the other Contracting Party through a permanent establishment situated therein. If the enterprise carries on business as aforesaid, the profits of the enterprise may be taxed in the other Party, but only so much of them as is attributable to:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 that permanent establishment;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 sales in that other Party of goods or merchandise of the same or similar kind as those sold through that permanent establishment; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 other business activities carried on in that other Party of the same or similar kind as those effected through that permanent establishment,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 provided that (b) or (c) shall not apply where an enterprise is able to demonstrate that the sales or business activities were carried out for reasons other than obtaining benefits under this Agreement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Subject to the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , where an enterprise of a Contracting Party carries on business in the other Contracting Party through a permanent establishment situated therein, there shall in each Contracting Party be attributed to that permanent establishment the profits which it might be expected to make if it were a distinct and separate enterprise engaged in the same or similar activities under the same or similar conditions and dealing wholly independently with the enterprise of which it is a permanent establishment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In determining the profits of a permanent establishment, there shall be allowed as deductions expenses which are incurred for the purposes of the business of the permanent establishment, including executive and general administrative expenses so incurred, whether in the Party in which the permanent establishment is situated or elsewhere. However, no such deduction shall be allowed in respect of amounts, if any, paid (other than towards reimbursement of actual expenses) by the permanent establishment to the head office of the enterprise or any of its other offices, by way of royalties, fees or other similar payments in return for the use of patents or other rights, or by way of commission, for specific services performed or for management, or, except in the case of a banking enterprise, by way of interest on money lent to the permanent establishment. Likewise, no account shall be taken, in the determination of the profits of a permanent establishment, for amounts charged, (otherwise than towards reimbursement of actual expenses), by the permanent establishment to the head office of the enterprise or any of its other offices, by way of royalties, fees or other similar payments in return for the use of patents or other rights, or by way of commission for specific services performed or for management, or, except in the case of banking enterprise, by way of interest on money lent to the head office of the enterprise or any of its other offices.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Insofar as it has been customary in a Contracting Party to determine the profits to be attributed to a permanent establishment on the basis of an apportionment of the total profits of the enterprise to its various parts, or on the basis of such other method as may be prescribed by the laws of that Party, nothing in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall preclude that Contracting Party from determining the profits to be taxed by such apportionment or other method; the method adopted shall, however, be such that the result shall be in accordance with the principles contained in this Article.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 No profits shall be attributed to a permanent establishment by reason of the mere purchase by that permanent establishment of goods or merchandise for the enterprise.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of the preceding paragraphs, the profits to be attributed to the permanent establishment shall be determined by the same method year by year unless there is good and sufficient reason to the contrary.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where profits include items of income which are dealt with separately in other Articles of this Agreement, then the provisions of those Articles shall not be affected by the provisions of this Article.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 8\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 SHIPPING AND AIR TRANSPORT\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Profits of an enterprise of a Contracting Party from the operation of aircraft in international traffic shall be taxable only in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Profits of an enterprise of a Contracting Party derived in the other Contracting Party from the operation of ships in international traffic may be taxed in the other Contracting Party but the tax so charged shall be reduced by an amount equal to 50 per cent thereof.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall also apply to profits from the participation in a pool, a joint business or an international operating agency.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of this Article, profits from the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic shall include in particular:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 revenues and gross receipts from the operation of ships or aircraft for the transport of persons, livestock, goods, mail or merchandise in international traffic including:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 income derived from the lease of ships or aircraft on a bareboat charter basis where such lease is incidental to the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 income derived from the sale of tickets and the provision of services connected with such transport whether for the enterprise itself or for any other enterprise, provided that in the case of provision of services, such provision is incidental to the operation of ships and aircraft in international traffic;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 interest on funds directly connected with the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 profits from the lease of containers by the enterprise, when such lease is incidental to the operation of ships or aircraft in international traffic.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 9\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 ASSOCIATED ENTERPRISES\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 an enterprise of a Contracting Party participates directly or indirectly in the management, control or capital of an enterprise of the other Contracting Party, or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the same persons participate directly or indirectly in the management, control or capital of an enterprise of a Contracting Party and an enterprise of the other Contracting Party,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 and in either case conditions are made or imposed between the two enterprises in their commercial or financial relations which differ from those which would be made between independent enterprises, then any profits which would, but for those conditions, have accrued to one of the enterprises, but, by reason of those conditions, have not so accrued, may be included in the profits of that enterprise and taxed accordingly.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where a Contracting Party includes in the profits of an enterprise of that Party - and taxes accordingly - profits on which an enterprise of the other Contracting Party has been charged to tax in that other Party and the profits so included are profits which would have accrued to the enterprise of the first-mentioned Party if the conditions made between the two enterprises had been those which would have been made between independent enterprises, then that other Party shall make an appropriate adjustment to the amount of the tax charged therein on those profits. In determining such adjustment, due regard shall be had to the other provisions of this Agreement and the competent authorities of the Contracting Parties shall if necessary consult each other.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 10\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 DIVIDENDS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Dividends paid by a company which is a resident of a Contracting Party to a resident of the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 However, such dividends may also be taxed in the Contracting Party of which the company paying the dividends is a resident and according to the laws of that Party, but if the beneficial owner of the dividends is a resident of the other Contracting Party, the tax so charged shall not exceed:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 5 per cent of the gross amount of the dividends if the beneficial owner is a company (other than a partnership) which holds directly at least 25 per cent of the capital of the company paying the dividends;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 10 per cent of the gross amount of the dividends in all other cases.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The competent authorities of the Contracting Parties shall by mutual agreement settle the mode of application of these limitations.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This paragraph shall not affect the taxation of the company in respect of the profits out of which the dividends are paid.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The term \u8220??dividends\u8221?? as used in this Article means income from shares or other rights, not being debt-claims, participating in profits, as well as income from other corporate rights which is subjected to the same taxation treatment as income from shares by the laws of the Party of which the company making the distribution is a resident.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not apply if the beneficial owner of the dividends, being a resident of a Contracting Party, carries on business in the other Contracting Party of which the company paying the dividends is a resident, through a permanent establishment situated therein, or performs in that other Party independent personal services from a fixed base situated therein, and the holding in respect of which the dividends are paid is effectively connected with such permanent establishment or fixed base. In such case, the provisions of Article 7 or Article 14, as the case may be, shall apply.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding any other provisions of this Agreement where a company which is a resident of a Contracting Party has a permanent establishment in the other Contracting Party, the profits of the permanent establishment may be subjected to an additional tax in that other Party in accordance with its law, but the additional tax so charged shall not exceed 5 per cent of the amount of such profits after deducting therefrom income tax and other taxes on income imposed thereon in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where a company which is a resident of a Contracting Party derives profits or income from the other Contracting Party, that other Party may not impose any tax on the dividends paid by the company, except insofar as such dividends are paid to a resident of that other Party or insofar as the holding in respect of which the dividends are paid is effectively connected with a permanent establishment or a fixed base situated in that other Party, nor subject the company\u8217??s undistributed profits to a tax on the company\u8217??s undistributed profits, even if the dividends paid or the undistributed profits consist wholly or partly of profits or income arising in such other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of this Article shall not apply if it was the main purpose or one of the main purposes of any person concerned with the creation or assignment of the shares or other rights in respect of which the dividend is paid to take advantage of this Article by means of that creation or assignment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 11\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 INTEREST\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Interest arising in a Contracting Party and paid to a resident of the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 However, such interest may also be taxed in the Contracting Party in which it arises and according to the laws of that Party, but if the beneficial owner of the interest is a resident of the other Contracting Party, the tax so charged shall not exceed 10 per cent of the gross amount of the interest. The competent authorities of the Contracting Parties shall by mutual agreement settle the mode of application of these limitations.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of this Article, interest arising in a Contracting Party is exempt from tax in that Party, if it is paid:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to the Hong Kong Monetary Authority;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (iii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to a statutory body, institution, or financial establishment appointed by the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region and mutually agreed upon by the competent authorities of the two Contracting Parties;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of Indonesia:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to the Government of the Republic of Indonesia;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to Bank Indonesia (the Central Bank of Indonesia);\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (iii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to Pusat Investasi Pemerintah (the Centre for Government Investment);\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (iv)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to Lembaga Pembiayaan Ekspor Indonesia (the Indonesia Eximbank);\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (v)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to a statutory body, institution, or financial establishment appointed by the Government of the Republic of Indonesia and mutually agreed upon by the competent authorities of the two Contracting Parties.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The term \u8220??interest\u8221?? as used in this Article means income from debt-claims of every kind, whether or not secured by mortgage and whether or not carrying a right to participate in the debtor\u8217??s profits, and in particular, income from government securities and income from bonds or debentures, including premiums and prizes attaching to such securities, bonds or debentures. Penalty charges for late payment shall not be regarded as interest for the purpose of this Article.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not apply if the beneficial owner of the interest, being a resident of a Contracting Party, carries on business in the other Contracting Party, in which the interest arises, through a permanent establishment situated therein, or performs in that other Party independent personal services from a fixed base situated therein, and the debt-claim in respect of which the interest is paid is effectively connected with (a) such permanent establishment or fixed base or with (b) business activities referred to in (c) of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 7. In such case, the provisions of Article 7 or Article 14, as the case may be, shall apply.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Interest shall be deemed to arise in a Contracting Party when the payer is a resident of that Party. Where, however, the person paying the interest, whether he is a resident of a Contracting Party or not, has in a Contracting Party a permanent establishment or a fixed base in connection with which the indebtedness on which the interest is paid was incurred, and such interest is borne by such permanent establishment or fixed base, then such interest shall be deemed to arise in the Party in which the permanent establishment or fixed base is situated.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where, by reason of a special relationship between the payer and the beneficial owner or between both of them and some other person, the amount of the interest exceeds, for whatever reasons, the amount which would have been agreed upon by the payer and the beneficial owner in the absence of such relationship, the provisions of this Article shall apply only to the last-mentioned amount. In such case, the excess part of the payments shall remain taxable according to the laws of each Contracting Party, due regard being had to the other provisions of this Agreement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 8.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of this Article shall not apply if it was the main purpose or one of the main purposes of any person concerned with the creation or assignment of the debt-claims in respect of which the interest is paid to take advantage of this Article by means of that creation or assignment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 12\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 ROYALTIES\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Royalties arising in a Contracting Party and paid to a resident of the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 However, such royalties may also be taxed in the Contracting Party in which they arise and according to the laws of that Party, but if the beneficial owner of the royalties is a resident of the other Contracting Party, the tax so charged shall not exceed 5 per cent of the gross amount of the royalties. The competent authorities of the Contracting Parties shall by mutual agreement settle the mode of application of these limitations.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The term \u8220??royalties\u8221?? as used in this Article means payments of any kind received as a consideration for the use of, or the right to use, any copyright of literary, artistic or scientific work including cinematograph films, or films or tapes or disc used for radio or television broadcasting, any patent, trade mark, design or model, plan, secret formula or process, or for the use of, or the right to use, industrial, commercial or scientific equipment or for information concerning industrial, commercial or scientific experience.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not apply if the beneficial owner of the royalties, being a resident of a Contracting Party, carries on business in the other Contracting Party in which the royalties arise, through a permanent establishment situated therein, or performs in that other Party independent personal services from a fixed base situated therein, and the right or property in respect of which the royalties are paid is effectively connected with (a) such permanent establishment or fixed base or with (b) business activities referred to in (c) of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 7. In such case, the provisions of Article 7 or Article 14, as the case may be, shall apply.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Royalties shall be deemed to arise in a Contracting Party when the payer is a resident of that Party. Where, however, the person paying the royalties, whether he is a resident of a Contracting Party or not, has in a Contracting Party a permanent establishment or a fixed base in connection with which the liability to pay the royalties was incurred, and such royalties are borne by such permanent establishment or fixed base, then such royalties shall be deemed to arise in the Party in which the permanent establishment or fixed base is situated.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where, by reason of a special relationship between the payer and the beneficial owner or between both of them and some other person, the amount of the royalties exceeds, for whatever reasons, the amount which would have been agreed upon by the payer and the beneficial owner in the absence of such relationship, the provisions of this Article shall apply only to the last-mentioned amount. In such case, the excess part of the payments shall remain taxable according to the laws of each Contracting Party, due regard being had to the other provisions of this Agreement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of this Article shall not apply if it was the main purpose or one of the main purposes of any person concerned with the creation or assignment of the rights in respect of which the royalties are paid to take advantage of this Article by means of that creation or assignment. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 13\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 CAPITAL GAINS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Gains derived by a resident of a Contracting Party from the alienation of immovable property referred to in Article 6 and situated in the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Gains from the alienation of movable property forming part of the business property of a permanent establishment which an enterprise of a Contracting Party has in the other Contracting Party or of movable property pertaining to a fixed base available to a resident of a Contracting Party in the other Contracting Party for the purpose of performing independent personal services, including such gains from the alienation of such a permanent establishment (alone or with the whole enterprise) or of such fixed base, may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Gains derived by an enterprise of a Contracting Party from the alienation of ships or aircraft operated in international traffic or movable property pertaining to the operation of such ships or aircraft shall be taxable only in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Gains derived by a resident of a Contracting Party from the alienation of shares of a company deriving more than 50 per cent of its asset value directly or indirectly from immovable property situated in the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Party. However, this paragraph does not apply to gains derived from the alienation of shares:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 alienated or exchanged in the framework of a reorganisation of a company, a merger, a scission or a similar operation; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in a company deriving more than 50 per cent of its asset value from immovable property in which it carries on its business.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Gains from the alienation of any property, other than that referred to in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , shall be taxable only in the Contracting Party of which the alienator is a resident.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 14\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 INDEPENDENT PERSONAL SERVICES\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Income derived by a resident of a Contracting Party in respect of professional services or other independent activities of a similar character shall be taxable only in that Contracting Party except in the following circumstances, when such income may also be taxed in the other Contracting Party:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 if he has a fixed base regularly available to him in the other Contracting Party for the purpose of performing his activities; in that case, only so much of the income as is attributable to that fixed base may be taxed in that other Contracting Party; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 if his stay in the other Contracting Party is for a period or periods amounting to or exceeding in the aggregate 183 days in any twelve-month period commencing or ending in the taxable period concerned; in that case, only so much of the income as is derived from his activities performed in that other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The term \u8220??professional services\u8221?? includes especially independent scientific, literary, artistic, educational or teaching activities as well as the independent activities of physicians, dentists, lawyers, engineers, architects and accountants.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 15\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 DEPENDENT PERSONAL SERVICES\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Subject to the provisions of Articles 16, 18 and 19, salaries, wages and other similar remuneration derived by a resident of a Contracting Party in respect of an employment shall be taxable only in that Party unless the employment is exercised in the other Contracting Party. If the employment is so exercised, such remuneration as is derived therefrom may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , remuneration derived by a resident of a Contracting Party in respect of an employment exercised in the other Contracting Party shall be taxable only in the first-mentioned Party if:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the recipient is present in the other Party for a period or periods not exceeding in the aggregate 183 days in any twelve-month period commencing or ending in the taxable period concerned, and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the remuneration is paid by, or on behalf of, an employer who is not a resident of the other Party, and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the remuneration is not borne by a permanent establishment or a fixed base which the employer has in the other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the preceding provisions of this Article, remuneration derived in respect of an employment exercised aboard a ship or aircraft operated in international traffic by an enterprise of a Contracting Party, may be taxed in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 16\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 DIRECTORS\u8217?? FEES\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 Directors\u8217?? fees and other similar payments derived by a resident of a Contracting Party in his capacity as a member of the board of directors or similar organ of a company which is a resident of the other Contracting Party may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qj\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qj\qj\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 17\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 ARTISTES AND SPORTSPERSONS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of Articles 14 and 15, income derived by a resident of a Contracting Party as an entertainer, such as a theatre, motion picture, radio or television artiste, or a musician, or as a sportsperson, from his personal activities as such exercised in the other Contracting Party, may be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where income in respect of personal activities exercised by an entertainer or a sportsperson in his capacity as such accrues not to the entertainer or sportsperson himself but to another person, that income may, notwithstanding the provisions of Articles 7, 14 and 15, be taxed in the Contracting Party in which the activities of the entertainer or sportsperson are exercised.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not apply to income derived from activities performed in a Contracting Party by artistes or sportspersons if the visit to that Party is wholly or mainly supported by public funds of one or both of the Contracting parties or political subdivisions or local authorities thereof. In such a case, the income is taxable only in the Contracting Party in which the artiste or the sportsperson is a resident.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 18\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 PENSIONS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Subject to the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 19, pensions and other similar remuneration (including a lump sum payment) paid to a resident of a Contracting Party in consideration of past employment or past self-employment shall be taxable only in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , pensions and other similar remuneration (including a lump sum payment) made under a pension or retirement scheme which is:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 a public scheme which is part of the social security system of a Contracting Party; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 a scheme in which individuals may participate to secure retirement benefits and which is recognised for tax purposes in a Contracting Party,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 shall be taxable only in that Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 19\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 GOVERNMENT SERVICE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-1200\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Salaries, wages and other similar remuneration, other than a pension, paid by the Government of a Contracting Party, or a political subdivision, or a local authority thereof to an individual in respect of services rendered to that Party or subdivision or authority shall be taxable only in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 However, such salaries, wages and other similar remuneration shall be taxable only in the other Contracting Party if the services are rendered in that Party and the individual is a resident of that Party who:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 in the case of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, has the right of abode therein and in the case of Indonesia, is a national thereof; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 did not become a resident of that Party solely for the purpose of rendering the services.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-1200\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Any pension (including a lump sum payment) paid by, or paid out of funds created or contributed by, the Government of a Contracting Party or a political subdivision or a local authority thereof to an individual in respect of services rendered to that Party or subdivision or authority shall be taxable only in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 However, if the individual who rendered the services is a resident of the other Contracting Party and the case falls within subparagraph (b) of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Article, any corresponding pension (whether a payment in lump sum or by instalments) shall be taxable only in that other Contracting Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of Articles 15, 16, 17 and 18 shall apply to salaries, wages, pensions (including a lump sum payment), and other similar remuneration in respect of services rendered in connection with a business carried on by the Government of a Contracting Party or a political subdivision or a local authority thereof.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 20\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 STUDENTS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 Payments which a student who is or was immediately before visiting a Contracting Party a resident of the other Contracting Party and who is present in the first-mentioned Party solely for the purpose of his education receives for the purpose of his maintenance or education shall not be taxed in that Party, provided that such payments arise from sources outside that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 21\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 OTHER INCOME\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Items of income of a resident of a Contracting Party, wherever arising, not dealt with in the foregoing Articles of this Agreement shall be taxable only in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not apply to income, other than income from immovable property as defined in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 6, if the recipient of such income, being a resident of a Contracting Party, carries on business in the other Contracting Party through a permanent establishment situated therein, or performs in that other Party independent personal services from a fixed base situated therein, and the right or property in respect of which the income is paid is effectively connected with such permanent establishment or fixed base. In such case, the provisions of Article 7 or Article 14, as the case may be, shall apply.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Alimony or other maintenance payment paid by a resident of a Contracting Party to a resident of the other Contracting Party shall, to the extent it is not allowable as a deduction to the payer in the first-mentioned Party, be taxable only in that Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , items of income of a resident of a Contracting Party not dealt with in the foregoing Articles of this Agreement and arising in the other Contracting Party may also be taxed in that other Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u160??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 CHAPTER IV\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 METHODS FOR ELIMINATION OF DOUBLE TAXATION\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 22\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 METHODS FOR ELIMINATION OF DOUBLE TAXATION\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Subject to the provisions of the laws of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region relating to the allowance of a credit against Hong Kong Special Administrative Region tax of tax paid in a jurisdiction outside the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region (which shall not affect the general principle of this Article), Indonesian tax paid under the laws of Indonesia and in accordance with this Agreement, whether directly or by deduction, in respect of income derived by a person who is a resident of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region from sources in Indonesia, shall be allowed as a credit against Hong Kong Special Administrative Region tax payable in respect of that income, provided that the credit so allowed does not exceed the amount of Hong Kong Special Administrative Region tax computed in respect of that income in accordance with the tax laws of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where a resident of Indonesia derives income which, in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement, may be taxed in the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, Indonesia shall allow as deduction from the tax on the income of that resident an amount equal to the income tax paid in the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region. Such deduction shall not, however, exceed the part of the income tax as computed before the deduction is given, which is attributable as the case may be, to the income which may be taxed in Indonesia.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u160??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 CHAPTER V\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 SPECIAL PROVISIONS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 23\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 NON-DISCRIMINATION\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Persons who, in the case of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, have the right of abode or are incorporated or otherwise constituted therein, and, in the case of Indonesia, are nationals of Indonesia, shall not be subjected in the other Contracting Party to any taxation or any requirement connected therewith, which is other or more burdensome than the taxation and connected requirements to which persons who have the right of abode or are incorporated or otherwise constituted in that other Party (where that other Party is the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region) or nationals of that other Party (where that other Party is Indonesia) in the same circumstances, in particular with respect to residence, are or may be subjected. This provision shall, notwithstanding the provisions of Article 1, also apply to persons who are not residents of one or both of the Contracting Parties.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Stateless persons who are residents of a Contracting Party shall not be subjected in either Contracting Party to any taxation or any requirement connected therewith, which is other or more burdensome than the taxation and connected requirements to which persons who have the right of abode in the Party (where the Party is the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region) or nationals of the Party (where the Party is Indonesia) in the same circumstances, in particular with respect to residence, are or may be subjected.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The taxation on a permanent establishment which an enterprise of a Contracting Party has in the other Contracting Party shall not be less favourably levied in that other Party than the taxation levied on enterprises of that other Party carrying on the same activities. This provision shall not be construed as obliging a Contracting Party to grant to residents of the other Contracting Party any personal allowances, reliefs and reductions for taxation purposes on account of civil status or family responsibilities which it grants to its own residents.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Except where the provisions of paragraph l of Article 9, }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 7}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 11, or }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 6}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 12 apply, interest, royalties and other disbursements paid by an enterprise of a Contracting Party to a resident of the other Contracting Party shall, for the purpose of determining the taxable profits of such enterprise, be deductible under the same conditions as if they had been paid to a resident of the first-mentioned Party.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Enterprises of a Contracting Party, the capital of which is wholly or partly owned or controlled, directly or indirectly, by one or more residents of the other Contracting Party, shall not be subjected in the first-mentioned Party to any taxation or any requirement connected therewith which is other or more burdensome than the taxation and connected requirements to which other similar enterprises of the first-mentioned Party are or may be subjected.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In this Article the term \u8220??taxation\u8221?? means taxes which are the subject of this Agreement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 24\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 MUTUAL AGREEMENT PROCEDURE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where a person considers that the actions of one or both of the Contracting Parties result or will result for him in taxation not in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement, he may, irrespective of the remedies provided by the domestic laws of those Parties, present his case to the competent authority of the Contracting Party of which he is a resident or, if his case comes under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Article 23, to that of the Contracting Party in which, in the case of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, he has the right of abode or is incorporated or otherwise constituted or, in the case of Indonesia, of which he is a national. The case must be presented within three years from the first notification of the action resulting in taxation not in accordance with the provisions of this Agreement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The competent authority shall endeavour, if the objection appears to it to be justified and if it is not itself able to arrive at a satisfactory solution, to resolve the case by mutual agreement with the competent authority of the other Contracting Party, with a view to the avoidance of taxation which is not in accordance with this Agreement. Any agreement reached shall be implemented notwithstanding any time limits in the domestic laws of the Contracting Parties.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The competent authorities of the Contracting Parties shall endeavour to resolve by mutual agreement any difficulties or doubts arising as to the interpretation or application of this Agreement. They may also consult together for the elimination of double taxation in cases not provided for in this Agreement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The competent authorities of the Contracting Parties may communicate with each other directly for the purpose of reaching an agreement in the sense of the preceding paragraphs. The competent authorities, through consultations, shall develop appropriate bilateral procedures, conditions, methods and techniques for the implementation of the mutual agreement procedure provided for in this Article.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 25\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 EXCHANGE OF INFORMATION\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The competent authorities of the Contracting Parties shall exchange such information as is foreseeably relevant for carrying out the provisions of this Agreement or to the administration or enforcement of the domestic laws of the Contracting Parties concerning taxes covered by this Agreement, insofar as the taxation thereunder is not contrary to the Agreement. The exchange of information is not restricted by Article 1.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Any information received under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  by a Contracting Party shall be treated as secret in the same manner as information obtained under the domestic laws of that Party and shall be disclosed only to persons or authorities (including courts and administrative bodies) concerned with the assessment or collection of, the enforcement or prosecution in respect of, or the determination of appeals in relation to the taxes referred to in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 . Such persons or authorities shall use the information only for such purposes. They may disclose the information in public court proceedings or in judicial decisions, including, in the case of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, the decisions of the Board of Review. Information shall not be disclosed to any third jurisdiction for any purpose.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In no case shall the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  be construed so as to impose on a Contracting Party the obligation:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 to carry out administrative measures at variance with the laws and administrative practice of that or of the other Contracting Party;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 to supply information which is not obtainable under the laws or in the normal course of the administration of that or of the other Contracting Party;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 to supply information which would disclose any trade, business, industrial, commercial or professional secret or trade process, or information the disclosure of which would be contrary to public policy.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 If information is requested by a Contracting Party in accordance with this Article, the other Contracting Party shall use its information gathering measures to obtain the requested information, even though that other Party may not need such information for its own tax purposes. The obligation contained in the preceding sentence is subject to the limitations of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  but in no case shall such limitations be construed to permit a Contracting Party to decline to supply information solely because it has no domestic interest in such information.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In no case shall the provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  be construed to permit a Contracting Party to decline to supply information solely because the information is held by a bank, other financial institution, nominee or person acting in an agency or a fiduciary capacity or because it relates to ownership interests in a person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 26\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\ul\cf1 \f0 MEMBERS OF GOVERNMENT MISSIONS\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 Nothing in this Agreement shall affect the fiscal privileges of members of government missions, including consular posts under the general rules of international law or