o that part of the contract which is carried out by the head office of the enterprise shall be taxable only in the Contracting Party of which the enterprise is a resident.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 With reference to Article 10:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The provisions of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 5}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  shall not affect the provisions contained in any production sharing contracts relating to oil and gas, and contracts of works for other mining sectors, concluded by the Government of the Republic of Indonesia or its relevant state oil and gas company or any other entity thereof with a person who is a resident of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 With reference to Article 25:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 It is understood that the Article does not create obligations as regards automatic or spontaneous exchanges of information between the Contracting Parties.\par }}
